[00:27.19]我才不要独自买醉"
[00:29.79]Said she loved my accent, so I kept talkin'
[00:29.79]她说爱我的口音 于是我话语绵长
[00:32.32]Reached for the pack on the table by my wallet
[00:32.32]伸手拿向桌上钱包旁的烟盒
[00:34.74]We tore off to light the night we had left
[00:34.74]我们趁夜未央 点燃余下的时光
[00:39.33]With 13 cigarettes
[00:39.33]剩下十三支香烟
[00:42.08]And I lit me one
[00:42.08]我点燃一支
[00:44.51]With the windows cracked
[00:44.51]车窗微摇
[00:46.89]In my old half-ton
[00:46.89]在我的旧皮卡里面
[00:49.43]Singin' Take Me Home
[00:49.43]唱起《带我回家》
[00:51.83]On them country roads
[00:51.83]在那乡间小路上
[00:54.04]So I turned off on one
[00:54.04]我拐向一条岔道
[00:56.78]Then next thing you know
[00:56.78]接下来便看见
[00:59.04]We had a beer bottle lookin' like an ashtray
[00:59.04]啤酒瓶成了我们的烟灰缸
[01:01.74]Under that full moon, she was 'bout halfway
[01:01.74]满月之下 她几乎就要
[01:04.16]Naked in my truck bed
[01:04.16]半裸在我的皮卡后斗
